   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Wide, high angle, slow push in  [STREET]\n\nSnowy 1840s Danish town street at dusk: gabled houses, snow falling,\ncandle-lit windows, cobbles under snow, nearly dark. Tiny figure of\nthe girl far down the street."
  },
  {
   "id": "s02",
   "dur": 5.0,
   "tc": "00:07–00:12",
   "lines": "2",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Medium-wide, tracking alongside  [STREET]\n\nThe girl walks: bareheaded, long fair curls with snow on them, thin\nragged dress, old apron full of matches, bundle in one hand, shuffling\nin a pair of far-too-big worn adult slippers."
  },
  {
   "id": "s03",
   "dur": 7.2917,
   "tc": "00:12–00:17",
   "lines": "3",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Wide, then she jumps back; end on her feet  [STREET]\n\nTwo dark carriages with horses rush past through snow; she leaps\naside; both slippers fly off; a ragged boy snatches one and runs off\nlaughing; end on her BARE feet, red and blue in the snow. From here on\nshe is barefoot."
  },
  {
   "id": "s04",
   "dur": 6.375,
   "tc": "00:17–00:23",
   "lines": "4–5",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Medium, low eye level  [STREET]\n\nShe holds out matches to hurrying, well-wrapped passers-by who don't\nlook at her."
  },
  {
   "id": "s05",
   "dur": 4.6667,
   "tc": "00:23–00:29",
   "lines": "6",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Close-up on her face, then her POV: glowing window  [STREET + warm window]\n\nSnowflakes in her hair; she looks up at a warm window where a family\ntable and a goose can just be glimpsed. Longing."
  },
  {
   "id": "s06",
   "dur": 5.7917,
   "tc": "00:29–00:35",
   "lines": "7",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Wide → medium, static  [STREET]\n\nTHE CORNER: she sits down where the two houses meet, draws her bare\nfeet up under her dress, hugs herself; wind blows snow."
  },
  {
   "id": "s07",
   "dur": 4.875,
   "tc": "00:35–00:41",
   "lines": "8 + strike",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Extreme close-up hands  [STREET → first warm light]\n\nNumb, red fingers pull one match from the bundle and strike it on the\nwall: a bright flame flares."
  },
  {
   "id": "s08",
   "dur": 9.7083,
   "tc": "00:41–00:50",
   "lines": "9–10",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Medium on girl, match light  [VISION → STREET]\n\nA big black iron stove with shining brass feet and a brass ornament\nappears before her, glowing; she stretches out her feet to it; the\nmatch dies, the stove fades, a burnt match in her fingers."
  },
  {
   "id": "s09",
   "dur": 5.8333,
   "tc": "00:50–00:56",
   "lines": "11",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x4a3010",
   "slate": "Over her shoulder toward the wall  [VISION]\n\nSecond match: the wall where the light falls turns transparent like a\nveil; through it, a room: snow-white tablecloth, fine porcelain, a\nroast goose steaming."
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "dur": 5.4583,
   "tc": "00:56–01:02",
   "lines": "12",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Inside the vision, low angle  [VISION → STREET]\n\nThe roast goose hops off the dish, a knife and fork stuck in its back,\nand waddles toward her — then darkness: cold damp wall again."
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "dur": 6.0,
   "tc": "01:02–01:08",
   "lines": "13",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x4a3010",
   "slate": "Wide low angle, from behind her looking up  [VISION]\n\nThird match: she sits beneath an enormous Christmas tree, thousands of\ncandles on its green branches, coloured pictures hanging; she reaches\nup."
  },
  {
   "id": "s12",
   "dur": 8.0,
   "tc": "01:08–01:16",
   "lines": "14–15",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x4a3010",
   "slate": "Tilt up from her face to the sky  [VISION → night sky]\n\nThe match goes out; the candle lights rise higher and higher into the\nnight sky and become stars; one star falls with a long trail of fire.\nHer face watches it."
  },
  {
   "id": "s13",
   "dur": 13.0833,
   "tc": "01:16–01:26",
   "lines": "16–17",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x4a3010",
   "slate": "Medium on her face, then reveal  [VISION, white-gold]\n\nFourth match flares; in its glow the GRANDMOTHER appears: old, mild,\nradiant, full of love, standing in light before the wall."
  },
  {
   "id": "s14",
   "dur": 2.4583,
   "tc": "01:26–01:30",
   "lines": "18",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x4a3010",
   "slate": "Close-up the girl  [VISION]\n\nTears, she reaches out to her grandmother: \"Grandmother! Take me with\nyou!\" (lip movement soft, may be partly hidden)."
  },
  {
   "id": "s15",
   "dur": 4.6667,
