   "lines": "19",
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x6e6030",
   "slate": "Close-up hands, then medium  [brilliant white-gold]\n\nShe strikes the WHOLE bundle at once against the wall; a blaze\nbrighter than daylight fills the corner."
  },
