   "slate": "Medium, static, slow push  [DAWN]\n\nDAWN, the same CORNER: the girl sits leaning against the wall, rosy\ncheeks, a small smile, eyes closed, snow on her; burnt matches beside\nher. Still, peaceful, unmistakably not alive."
  },
